  "description": "Intent: Block-tier hard enforcement on Cloud Storage share / copy / move at sensitivity floor [3,4] — shuts down sensitive data exfil via sharing or cross-account transfers in cloud storage (Box, Drive, SharePoint, Dropbox). Exclusions: excludes accounts in Cloud_Destination_Accounts_Authorized_[ends_with] and users in Users_Authorized_Internal_User_Suffixes_[ends_with]; ships disabled — enable after sanctioned cloud-account suffixes are populated and W2010 reviews are clean. Requirements: WIP — pending analyst testing.",
